@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost README · 本地开发（link 方式）：在 profile 的 `package.json` 里加依赖与 bundle，然后重启：

```jsonc
{
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost"] } },
  "dependencies": { "@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost": "link:/Users/you/dsh-deepseek-cost" }
}

并让 `node_modules/@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost` 指向该目录（`pnpm install` 或手工软链）。
插件行由 `cordis.patch.yml` 自动插入，id 为 `deepseek-cost`。

@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost README · Local development (`link:`)：Add the dependency and bundle to the profile's `package.json`, then restart:

```jsonc
{
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost"] } },
  "dependencies": { "@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost": "link:/Users/you/dsh-deepseek-cost" }
}

and point `node_modules/@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost` at this directory (`pnpm install`
or a manual symlink). The plugin row (`id: deepseek-cost`) is inserted by
`cordis.patch.yml`.

@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost README · FAQ：**Why do today/week/month show `—`?**
Those require the Platform login (Settings → Account). Signed out, only the API-key
balance is available.

@skyrocks/dsh-deepseek-cost README · Development：```sh
node test/smoke.mjs     # unit tests: pricing, peak hours, bucketing, Platform parsing, codec
```
